    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive dark technical aesthetic with disciplined cyan/red accents, clear card grouping, and responsive reflow. However, pervasive tiny low-contrast mono labels and body copy impair legibility; the desktop hero has excessive dead space and an awkwardly detached annotation; mobile cards become dense and the ablation rows feel cramped. The global header also visibly truncates navigation at tablet/mobile sizes, while the mobile brand name and red-mode action disappear, weakening hierarchy and polish.",
